labelled: 2026-09-29
--- code
export function formatAuditKey(book: BookKind, period: PeriodKind): string {
  return `${book}/${period}`;
}
--- facts
The audit archive keeps the history of each book's audit under the key this function returns.
So this function builds the key from the book and period values, and renaming either value starts a new history.
